# New Turnstone process and reopened resident composition; origin is still dead.
settle 100
key escape
assert snap network-offline == true
assert text Connected to resident inference.
assert text 1 saved sources chosen
assert text Past asks
capture 10_cold_reopened_scope_and_history
click surface:contributed role:button Reopen: Repeat the retained sentence about the Pelican observatory
settle 5
assert text Finished
assert text café
assert text Source 1:
click surface:contributed role:button Source 1:
settle 8
wait-saved-reader 600
assert snap saved-reader-state == Ready
assert snap saved-reader-text == The Pelican observatory's access word is café.
assert snap saved-reader-quote == The Pelican observatory's access word is café.
assert snap saved-reader-origin ~ /A
capture 11_cold_reopened_exact_A1_citation
record-saved-sources 11_cold_reopened_exact_A1_citation
act Save session
log R3 cold reopen retains chosen B, old answer, exact A1 and Unicode passage

# The encoded corpus cap refuses Answers visibly and never blocks local reading.
key escape
omnibar actions
type Switch to session R3 Oversize Three
key enter
settle 8
act Ask saved sources
settle 120
act Maximize pane
settle 5
assert text This session has too much saved text for Answers.
capture 12_oversize_publication_refused
act Search saved sources
type oversize saved marker
wait-saved-sources 600
assert suggestions == 1
key enter
wait-saved-reader 1200
assert snap saved-reader-state == Ready
assert snap saved-reader-quote == oversize saved marker
capture 13_oversize_source_readable_offline
record-saved-sources 13_oversize_source_readable_offline
log Oversize publication refused while exact local source reading remains available

# Restore the original research context before the resident's final checkpoint.
key escape
omnibar actions
type Switch to session R3 Private One
key enter
settle 120
assert text Connected to resident inference.
assert text 1 saved sources chosen
act Save session
